                        


Item #:  SCP-5429

Object Class:  Safe

Special Containment Procedures: 

SCP-5429 is to be kept in a standard anomalous item containment locker at Site ██.

All personal wishing to use SCP-5429 for personal application may do so after psycological evaluation and approoval by Dr.██████.

Recovery: 

SCP-5429 was discoverd in an abandoned building located at ██,█████° lat | █,█████° lon by MTF Epsilon-6 () operatives.

Description: 

SCP-5429 is a glass sphere, roughly 5cm in diameter. When in it's inactive state, SCP-5429 emmits a slight white glow.

SCP-5429 enters it's active state when picked up by a person, dissatisfied with their current gender. Upon activation, SCP-5429 glows in the stereotypical color of the diesired gender. About 2 seconds later, SCP-5429 starts a transformation process to the desired gender, taking 5 to 10 seconds on average. The subject experiences no pain while transforming, although strong confusion is common upon subjects. While in the process of transforming, no known method can part SCP-5429 and the subject. When the procces is over, SCP-5429 will produce a 0,5cm x 4cm note with the message . Completely transformed subjects are a 100% match to their desired gender.

